      "description": "One curve per lane from whatever the engine reports: Radiance/vLLM expose gpu_prefix_cache_hit_rate or hits/queries counters; llama.cpp derives it from prompt_tokens_cached_total against cached+uncached prompt tokens (its prompt_tokens_total EXCLUDES cached tokens, so the denominator has to add them back).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
